    {
      "name": "Static Shock",
      "actions": -1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature touches the storm snake or damages it with an unarmed melee attack or non-reach melee weapon</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The triggering enemy is shocked for <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">2d8</span> electricity damage (DC 19 basic Fortitude save). On a failed save, the target is Stunned 1.</p>",
